107	          </span>
108	          <div className="min-w-0 flex-1">
109	            <h2 className="text-[20px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.02em] text-white">Backups</h2>
110	            <p className="mt-1.5 max-w-[68ch] text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-white/75">
111	              Two kinds, and they do different jobs. <strong className="text-white">Server images</strong> are
112	              a full copy of the machine on separate storage — the one to restore if the disk is lost.{" "}
113	              <strong className="text-white">World archives</strong> are just the {gameLabel} save, small and
114	              quick, for before you try something risky.
