267	              </dl>
268	              <p className="mt-3 text-[11.5px] leading-relaxed text-tx-faint">
269	                Server images live on separate, redundant storage so one survives losing the server&apos;s
270	                own disk. World archives sit on the server itself — download the ones that matter.
271	              </p>
272	            </Card>
273	          </div>
274	        </div>
